d closer cooperation as both nations seek to reduce reliance on the US. Canada's government said it had agreed to further reduce tariffs on a range of products.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Modi to attend ASEAN, Quad meet in Manila</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:92a1b08ec83ce43962a7a7b398326fa1cd478b1c5335926da906cbb01fadbb64</id><updated>2026-11-17T08:10:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T06:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-modi-to-attend-asean-quad-meet-in-manila/live-79964913--7675911af243.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-modi-to-attend-asean-quad-meet-in-manila/live-79964913?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">This is the first time Modi and US President Donald Trump are meeting since the US midterm elections, which changed the political scene in the US.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Mongolian President Khurelsukh to resign amid corruption allegations</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d58e981fd3a621a7838476c51462aeba57da910b843127751b9f83b9c5a26313</id><updated>2026-11-17T08:10:40Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T05:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/mongolian-president-khurelsukh-to-resign-amid-corruption-allegations/a-79964717--8f5d5c920ebb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/mongolian-president-khurelsukh-to-resign-amid-corruption-allegations/a-79964717?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Khurelsukh has said he will step down over accusations that he profited from a government railway project, but said he had been "falsely accused."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Japan scrambles jets to counter suspected Russian aircraft</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:db53b9ae703210ceffb7b6b47e17bfdbf96b54a0890b26ca357023184e49add4</id><updated>2026-11-17T08:10:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T03:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/japan-scrambles-jets-to-counter-suspected-russian-aircraft/a-79964537--8dcebae15e8b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/japan-scrambles-jets-to-counter-suspected-russian-aircraft/a-79964537?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Japan said it lodged a "very stern protest" with Moscow after two suspected Russian aircraft violated Japanese airspace.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine updates: Key bridges in Kyiv, Crimea hit in strikes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:af7be75da9e8bd0b67aa05fe07ebca2007b14b64dd8bf03effc517ab73900602</id><updated>2026-11-17T08:10:46Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T02:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-updates-key-bridges-in-kyiv-crimea-hit-in-strikes/live-79964446--54fb9e85dce7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-updates-key-bridges-in-kyiv-crimea-hit-in-strikes/live-79964446?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Kyiv's mayor said Russian forces have hit bridges on the Dnipro River. Ukraine launched a massive attack on Russia earlier on Monday, hitting the Crimean Bridge. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany beat Netherlands 5-0 to win Nations League group</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:438ca85c19fb7b4e6f6760d51fb1bf52a47eb9bfd29682ff9205013665d5572f</id><updated>2026-11-17T08:10:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T23:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-beat-netherlands-5-0-to-win-nations-league-group/a-79964394--6bc86424ecf4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-beat-netherlands-5-0-to-win-nations-league-group/a-79964394?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Florian Wirtz scored twice as Germany cruised to a comfortable 5-0 win over t