gories for the highest accolade in the music industry.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>NASA's Voyager 1 reaches a light-day away from Earth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:03ccec4e16d49c4918dc5411566e29ff80fe2f8988f01cb6933019bde75d2971</id><updated>2026-11-17T08:09:33Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T17:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nasa-s-voyager-1-reaches-a-light-day-away-from-earth/a-79961817--190e9087abf2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nasa-s-voyager-1-reaches-a-light-day-away-from-earth/a-79961817?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">When just saying 'hello' takes a two-day round trip, you're a light-day, or 26 billion kilometers, from Earth. Only one human-made object has ever traveled that far — and its journey into interstellar space continues.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>What has changed in James Bond films over the decades</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:254781bca3c1450d87a228f38b9acc59966422be3b92f044cd7e549ea04f4045</id><updated>2026-11-17T08:09:33Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T17:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-has-changed-in-james-bond-films-over-the-decades/a-63332001--7d894a9cd4fe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-has-changed-in-james-bond-films-over-the-decades/a-63332001?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In 1962, a martini-drinking womanizer saved the world for the first time in "Dr. No." As Robert Pattinson takes on the role of 007, here's how the films evolved.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia scandal: China's chips dilemma, US rivalry shape AI race</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f50df919bc7edb0ac5b8ea8fcef204bd74788cc7a201b383d1d99340c0b9c2f3</id><updated>2026-11-17T08:09:33Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T16:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../